  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan Growth Multi-Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Growth MDTF is designed to provide a Five-Year holistic support for the Government of Jordan (GoJ) to implement the five-year reform matrix, that was developed at the London conference in 2019. The main objective of the reforms is to achieve sustainable economic growth and jobs creation. 
- Sound governance and economic management
- Increased private sector growth and competitiveness
- Improved labour markets and social safety nets
- Improved efficiency and effectiveness in transportation, water, and energy sectors</narrative>
  </description>
